WEBVTT

00:05:58.354 --> 00:06:00.356
to see themselves in a career.

00:06:01.315 --> 00:06:03.234
Now, some people worry.

00:06:03.275 --> 00:06:04.443
They ask us,

00:06:04.443 --> 00:06:07.488
"Aren't you sacrificing the quality
of your candidate pool

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:10.449
by including justice-involved
individuals?"

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.785
Just to be clear --

00:06:13.869 --> 00:06:17.039
fair-chance hiring
is about increasing equity,

00:06:17.081 --> 00:06:20.668
not about reducing our hiring standards.

00:06:21.544 --> 00:06:24.088
In fact, the Society
for Human Resource Management

00:06:24.088 --> 00:06:27.299
has conducted extensive
research in this space,

00:06:27.341 --> 00:06:30.511
and they've found that 82 percent
of hiring managers